{"data":{"title":"I'll Erase Away Your Pain","slug":"ill-erase-away-your-pain","path":"/artists/the-whatnauts/tracks/i-ll-erase-away-your-pain/","artwork":"images/artists/the-whatnauts/tracks/i-ll-erase-away-your-pain.jpg","artist":{"id":"K2zMhOi5LoQ","slug":"the-whatnauts","links":null,"title":"The Whatnauts","artwork":null},"id":"rxgQ2Fsp8CM"},"appearanceCount":7,"markers":[{"chapter":{"id":"gmzM8IrDZbE","show":{"id":"YOEsiCCf8Ts","slug":"546","title":"Soulection Radio Show #546","artwork":"images/episodes/soulection-radio-show-546.jpg","content":"Joe Kay is back with his favorite UK garage, house, and samples.\n<!--more-->\n","published_at":"2022-04-23T00:00:00+00:00"}}},{"chapter":{"id":"Ea-1JydLRkA","show":{"id":"EVMFTD6oGnE","slug":"180","title":"Soulection Radio Show #180 w/ Hannah Faith","artwork":"/images/episodes/180.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","published_at":"2014-07-19T01:00:00+00:00"}}},{"chapter":{"id":"UQKUtJsffKA","show":{"id":"cdnqQ9xehXc","slug":"195","title":"Soulection Radio Show #195","artwork":"/images/episodes/195.jpg","content":"Joe Kay continues the freestyle of all music. \n\n<!--more-->\nLast week's show was definitely one of my favorites to date. It's weird how things work. It's the shows that I feel most unprepared for that end up doing well... maybe it's because I just really freestyle and go off of my whole library of music rather than trying to curate a specific vibe. It was hard to top last week's show but I did my best to really take it right back to the early beat era from 2008-2012 and played some current gems as well. I hope you enjoy this. I'll be back next week with a guest maybe.\n\nBless.\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","published_at":"2014-11-29T00:00:00+00:00"}}},{"chapter":{"id":"hulhXaPjRNA","show":{"id":"ja5IOjwtCZg","slug":"287","title":"Soulectio